TAGTAB='Open the Notifications page from the bell and select the Tag groups tab. An active location is selected (top-right location selector).'
def seed_group(): return ('Seed a tag group: on the Tag groups tab click New tag group, type a Name (e.g. "Service Team"), '
    'pick at least one Member (e.g. "Ashlee Thomas"), leave Public off (or turn it on for a public group), and Create.')

